    "terrainName": "basic-desert",
    "description": "What: CE-2476 / CE-2475 perception suite P2b (Sensing \u00a78.6e) - on basic-desert a 'Red Shooter' inside a one-storey TIMBER HOUSE (8 x 6 m at (300,300)), just inside its north wall, fires at a 'Blue Target' in the same room; two passive Blue listeners stand 7 m north of the house. The sound reaches them straight through the thin north wall AND round the house through its open south door and its east / west windows (4.5-5 m from him). Judge: the ear takes its DIRECTION from the first wavefront - the straight way through the thin wall (12 dB) - not from the louder way round: both listeners believe him where he is (within 2 m), never at the door or a window, and the squad holds him once. Fail: he is believed at an opening. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh pe-wall-and-door"
